// The curve is fitted to the GL5528 row of the page 2 table of Senba's GL55 manual, not to its
// figures. The table gives 10 to 20 kohm at 10 lx and a gamma of 0.6 between 10 and 100 lx, so
// the fit holds 3.77 kohm at 100 lx. Above 100 lx the sheet gives no value, and the fit is the
// same line extended.
